# Optional. Leave BOTH unset and the site still works perfectly:
# give-clicks are stored locally and the Impact page renders the
# committed snapshot in src/data/impact-snapshot.json.
#
# Set these to turn on live tracking (Supabase free tier).
# The anon key is PUBLIC by design and is safe to commit to a public repo:
# row-level security in supabase/schema.sql restricts it to INSERT-only
# on give_clicks plus SELECT on the two read-only public views.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
